WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.413
Next, which cloud.

2
00:00:01.413 --> 00:00:06.013
The new read in this chapter is the
directory audit log in Microsoft Graph.

3
00:00:06.013 --> 00:00:09.991
This estate's GCC tenant uses
the worldwide Graph endpoint,

4
00:00:09.991 --> 00:00:14.213
and its Azure reads go to the
commercial Resource Manager host.

5
00:00:14.213 --> 00:00:18.908
GCC High and the Department of Defense
clouds have their own Graph hosts,

6
00:00:18.908 --> 00:00:23.369
and Learn lists the audit API as
available in both government levels,

7
00:00:23.369 --> 00:00:25.638
with PIM available everywhere too.

8
00:00:25.638 --> 00:00:29.910
As in every chapter, the cloud is
a required choice with no default,

9
00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:33.380
and the reader refuses to
send a token anywhere else.
